  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Changing `EncFalmer01Template` 03B54C also needs `EncFalmer01Shaman` 025D36 (level 5, on *Falmer Shaman*) and `DLC1_BF_FrozenFalmerMeleeTemplate` 01511E:Dawnguard.esm (the Frozen Falmer base, level 1; the five Frozen Falmer records keep their own levels too): they use 03B54C as their template but not for `Stats`.",
      "Changing `EncFalmer02Template` 03B54D also needs `EncFalmer02Shaman` 025D34 (level 8, on *Falmer Shaman*), `EncFalmer02MeleeBoss` 052387 and `EncFalmer02SpellswordBoss` 06322D (level 18, on *Falmer Boss*): same pattern.",
      "Changing `EncFalmer03Template` 029980 also needs `EncFalmer03Shaman` 025D2E (level 14, on *Falmer Shaman*), `EncFalmer03MeleeBoss` 05238C and `EncFalmer03SpellswordBoss` 06322F (level 26, on *Falmer Boss*): same pattern.",
      "Changing `EncFalmer04Template` 03B54E also needs `EncFalmer04Shaman` 025D30 (level 19, on *Falmer Shaman*), `EncFalmer04MeleeBoss` 05238D and `EncFalmer04SpellswordBoss` 06322E (level 35, on *Falmer Boss*): same pattern.",
      "Changing `EncFalmer05Template` 03B54F also needs `EncFalmer05Shaman` 025D32 (level 25, on *Falmer Shaman*), `EncFalmer05MeleeBoss` 05238E and `EncFalmer05SpellswordBoss` 063230 (level 44, on *Falmer Boss*): same pattern.",
      "Changing the melee rungs also needs `TG08BFalmerScene` 094C8A (level 1, two refs in `Irkngthand02` 07614C): it takes its template from `LCharFalmerMelee` 01E77D, which draws them, without `Stats`.",
      "`DLC1_BF_FrozenFalmerMelee01`–`05`, `DLC1FalmerFeralMelee`: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "The Falmer Servant follows the bandit ladder; the records that keep their own level beside it are listed on *Common Bandits*.",
      "The Warmonger template `DLC1EncFalmer06Template` 015CAC:Dawnguard.esm is a Falmer with no template and level 48; it is on *Falmer Boss*.",
      "Every other Falmer record (the melee, archer and spellsword `A`/`B` leaves, the `DLC1EncFalmer0{2–5}MeleeHeavy` leaves, `TreasCorpseFalmer`, the other `Lvl*Falmer*` wrappers) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
